{"version":1,"content":"<p>前港姐亞軍何依婷自2023年底與富二代男友Cedric在峇里島閃婚後，去年4月順利誕下愛女，正式榮升幸福人妻及人母。</p><p>婚後生活愈趨富貴的她，日前與丈夫一同盛裝出席「香港馬主協會2026周年晚宴」，不僅在社交平台大晒恩愛，更自爆手氣極旺抽中名貴</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T11:20:01.179449+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T11:01:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T11:13:32.028820+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T11:13:32.028820+00:00","content_hash":"d52f65adac5ca596621841e6d685ee5ab95db5aa7b5277e7b2ea84bb372e17be","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}